   "cooked": "<p>Hello! We are very excited about this epic day! If you’d like to join us and get some $TEC, these are the steps you need to follow:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Get some wxDai! Go to <a href=\"https://app.honeyswap.org/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Honeyswap</a>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Connect your wallet, you need to have xDai to wrap it into wxDai.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3.jpeg\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"gfvOi0L44GYay9G8TBODf03Mcwj\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3_2_10x10.png\" height=\"451\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3_2_602x451.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3_2_602x451.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3_2_903x676.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/71e3b4a18c6c02881c4648188017dc3e1f24a6f3_2_1204x902.jpeg 2x\" width=\"602\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×1199 77.1 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f.jpeg\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"7lmy2BCc3eIX1FYjCJBHBi9om3J\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f_2_10x10.png\" height=\"451\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f_2_602x451.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f_2_602x451.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f_2_903x676.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/337972524aed935fa95e582bb7e82bab472a6f8f_2_1204x902.jpeg 2x\" width=\"602\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×1199 76.4 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Go to the <a href=\"https://convert.tecommons.org/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">TEC Converter</a> and connect your wallet to swap your wxDai for TEC Tokens.</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168.jpeg\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"xCqzsCQsf2f9P2GAqOhajR2t3NC\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168_2_10x10.png\" height=\"451\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168_2_602x451.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168_2_602x451.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168_2_903x676.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb9fcc6154eb814c33a8a4f16baeb6778383a168_2_1204x902.jpeg 2x\" width=\"602\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×1199 87.2 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Now that you’re all set, go to the <a href=\"https://gardens.1hive.org/#/xdai/garden/0x1fc7e8d8e4bbbef77a4d035aec189373b52125a8\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">TEC Garden</a> and sign our covenant to start participating in our governance and advance token engineering!</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae.jpeg\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"nKTT81T2C7OlnxX0CUNBveFYCi\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae_2_10x10.png\" height=\"451\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae_2_602x451.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae_2_602x451.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae_2_903x676.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/02af78c4d2e5058de5a947db6cbdb8a36e7315ae_2_1204x902.jpeg 2x\" width=\"602\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×1199 203 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>This amazing guide was put together by <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/anatech\">@AnaTech</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/angieberryberry\">@angieberryberry</a></p>",
